From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jiaming Zhang <r772577952@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 15:07:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] executor, sys: miscellaneous updates for NetBSD

Update some logic in executor to enable coverage-guided testing for
NetBSD, supplement some headers and defines in syscall description,
add some macros and include directories in sys/syz-extract, and use
clang++ from NetBSD's package as CC compiler.
---
